{"title":"Career Roadmap · Aviation Legal Advisor","role":"Aviation Legal Advisor","summary":"An Aviation Legal Advisor provides legal and regulatory advice to airlines, airports, aircraft operators, aviation companies, lessors, manufacturers, aviation-service providers, insurers, government bodies and other participants in the aviation ecosystem.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Aviation / Space / Maritime Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Aviation Legal Advisor provides legal and regulatory advice to airlines, airports, aircraft operators, aviation companies, lessors, manufacturers, aviation-service providers, insurers, government bodies and other participants in the aviation ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aviation Regulation","Commercial Law","Contracts","Safety","Liability","International Law"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation regulatory research"},{"text":"Airline and airport regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Aircraft leasing"},{"text":"Aircraft purchase/sale transactions"},{"text":"Aviation contracts"},{"text":"Passenger rights"},{"text":"Aviation insurance"},{"text":"Airport agreements"},{"text":"Ground-handling agreements"},{"text":"Aircraft financing"},{"text":"Aviation safety and liability"},{"text":"Accident/incident legal support"},{"text":"Employment and crew matters"},{"text":"International aviation agreements"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"},{"text":"Regulatory correspondence"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Professional qualification note","text":"“Aviation Legal Advisor” is an employment designation. Legal practice, representation and formal advisory work must comply with applicable professional requirements. Aviation-specific regulatory permissions and operational requirements are separate from legal qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB","Aviation / Transport / International Law","Aviation Law Internship","Legal Research + Aviation Regulatory Knowledge","Legal Executive / Junior Associate","Aviation Legal Advisor","Senior Aviation Counsel","Legal Manager – Aviation","Head – Legal / General Counsel"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law Degree","Corporate / Commercial Law","Aviation Contracts / Leasing","Airline / Airport Legal Department","Aviation Counsel"]}]},{"heading":"Aviation Legal Ecosystem","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An aviation lawyer needs to understand the complete ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"AVIATION"},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"AIRLINES AIRPORTS AIRCRAFT"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Passengers Operators Manufacturers"},{"type":"p","text":"Crew Ground Ops Lessors"},{"type":"p","text":"Cargo Infrastructure Financiers"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"flow","items":["└──────────────────┼──────────────────┘","REGULATORS"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"p","text":"┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"p","text":"SAFETY COMMERCIAL INTERNATIONAL"},{"type":"p","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"p","text":"Liability Contracts Treaties"},{"type":"p","text":"Insurance Leasing Conventions"},{"type":"p","text":"Compliance Financing Cross-border"}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build the core legal foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Law of torts"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Legal reasoning"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal writing"},{"text":"Administrative law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Business management"},{"text":"Commercial transactions"},{"text":"Corporate finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These become important when working with airlines, airports and aircraft transactions."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Commercial & Transport Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop commercial-law expertise."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Sale of goods"},{"text":"Insurance law"},{"text":"Consumer law"},{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Labour and employment law"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"International commercial law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation application"},{"type":"p","text":"Apply these concepts to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline contracts"},{"text":"Aircraft purchase"},{"text":"Leasing"},{"text":"Airport agreements"},{"text":"Passenger services"},{"text":"Cargo agreements"},{"text":"Maintenance agreements"},{"text":"Ground handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Aviation Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Study the legal framework surrounding civil aviation."},{"type":"h","text":"Core areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation regulation"},{"text":"Air transport regulation"},{"text":"Aircraft registration"},{"text":"Airworthiness concepts"},{"text":"Airline licensing"},{"text":"Airport regulation"},{"text":"Passenger rights"},{"text":"Aviation safety"},{"text":"Air carrier liability"},{"text":"Cargo liability"},{"text":"Aviation insurance"},{"text":"Aircraft financing"},{"text":"Aircraft leasing"},{"text":"International aviation law"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Aviation rules involve multiple layers of domestic law, international conventions, regulatory requirements and industry standards. The lawyer must always verify the current rules applicable to the specific jurisdiction and transaction."}]},{"heading":"International Aviation Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Aviation is inherently international."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International air transport"},{"text":"Airspace"},{"text":"Aircraft nationality"},{"text":"International aviation agreements"},{"text":"Passenger liability"},{"text":"International carriage"},{"text":"Airport access"},{"text":"Cross-border operations"},{"text":"Aviation security"},{"text":"International dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International aviation structure"},{"type":"flow","items":["International Framework","National Aviation Law","Civil Aviation Regulator","Airline / Airport","Aircraft / Passenger / Cargo","Contract / Liability / Compliance"]}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Leasing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft leasing is an important legal practice area."},{"type":"h","text":"Types to understand"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operating lease"},{"text":"Finance lease"},{"text":"Sale and leaseback"},{"text":"Aircraft financing arrangements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leasing lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Selection","Commercial Negotiation","Due Diligence","Lease Agreement","Registration / Regulatory Checks","Delivery","Operation","Maintenance","Lease Payments","Return / Renewal"]},{"type":"h","text":"Lawyer's work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lease review"},{"text":"Title verification"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Security interests"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Maintenance obligations"},{"text":"Default provisions"},{"text":"Repossession"},{"text":"Return conditions"}]}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Purchase & Sale","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Aviation legal advisors may support aircraft transactions."},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Identification","Commercial Terms","Due Diligence","Purc