auses"},{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Indemnities"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Policy compliance"}]}]},{"heading":"Aviation Safety & Security","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A legal advisor should understand the distinction between technical safety requirements and the legal/regulatory framework surrounding them."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation safety regulation"},{"text":"Maintenance compliance"},{"text":"Crew requirements"},{"text":"Airport security"},{"text":"Operational standards"},{"text":"Incident reporting"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"},{"text":"Regulatory investigations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The lawyer does not replace aviation engineers, safety professionals or regulators; instead, they interpret and manage the legal implications."}]},{"heading":"Aviation Regulatory Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A compliance framework may look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Requirement","Identify Obligation","Responsible Department","Compliance Evidence","Internal Review","Regulatory Filing / Notification","Monitoring","Corrective Action"]},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain a compliance register covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Licence requirements"},{"text":"Safety obligations"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Aircraft documentation"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Environmental requirements"},{"text":"Consumer obligations"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Aircraft Lease Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional aircraft lease and analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parties"},{"text":"Aircraft"},{"text":"Delivery"},{"text":"Rent"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Default"},{"text":"Repossession"},{"text":"Return conditions"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Airline Regulatory Complian